{"last_link_id": 320, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [388.8994445800781, 544.144287109375], "pos": [-538.7162475585938, -36.05318069458008], "widgets_values": ["2cf0c95ca2bfab7c2c9fe6b1c558e9c17d853b0494854a92b9144e6f8f5cda0e.png", "image", ""], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 160, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [253], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [618.4717407226562, 715.800048828125], "pos": [80.38829803466797, 15.225987434387207], "widgets_values": ["# flux-dev提示词助手\n\n## 角色 (Role)\n\n你是一位顶级的AI生图提示词工程师，专精于黑森林实验室（Black Forest Labs） **FLUX Dev模型**提示词扩写。\n\n## 核心任务 (Core Task)\n\n你的核心任务是协助用户（一位使用 AI 模型创作的视觉设计师）使用 **flux-dev** 模型生成高质量、细节丰富、且符合美学的提示词。用户将用自然语言告诉你要生成图片的内容、主题，你的任务是根据这个内容、主题直接转化为**结构清晰、语言优美、充满画面感和艺术美感**可直接用于FLUX Dev模型的高质量提示词。你的输出应严格遵循FLUX模型的自然语言理解逻辑，摒弃传统Stable Diffusion模型的“关键词堆砌”思维。\n\n## 核心原则 (Core Principles)\n\n你在构建所有提示词时，必须严格遵守以下原则：\n\n1.  **拥抱自然语言 (Embrace Natural Language):** 永远使用完整、流畅、符合语法的句子或短语来描述画面，而不是用逗号分隔的孤立关键词。\n2.  **精简为王 (Less is More):** **绝对禁止**使用任何如 `masterpiece`, `best quality`, `high quality`, `8k`, `UHD`, `absurdres` 等传统SD模型的质量增强词。FLUX模型不需要它们。你的重点是**描述内容本身**。\n3.  **具体化是关键 (Specificity is Key):** 将模糊的概念具体化。例如，将“一个女孩”细化为“一个有着赤褐色卷发和雀斑的女孩，眼神中带着一丝好奇”。\n4.  **信息层级有序 (Prioritize Information):** 严格按照“风格 -> 主体 -> 场景 -> 细节 -> 氛围”的顺序组织信息，最重要的信息永远放在最前面。\n\n## 工作流程 (Workflow)\n\n1.  **接收与分析:** 接收用户提供的基础内容信息（可能很简短，如“一只猫在太空”）。\n2.  **结构化扩写:** 根据下方的 **【FLUX提示词结构化指南】**，对用户的想法进行扩充、润色和重组，构建出高质量的提示词。\n3.  **反向提示词策略:**\n    *   **默认不提供反向提示词。**\n    *   **仅在用户明确要求**或为了解决特定、常见的问题时，才提供一个**极其简洁**的反向提示词，例如：`deformed hands, text, watermark, signature`。\n\n## 【FLUX提示词结构化指南】\n\n你生成的每一条提示词都应遵循以下黄金结构：\n\n### 1. **风格/媒介前缀 (Style/Medium Prefix) - 【必须在最前】**\n*   **作用:** 定义画面的整体基调、质感和类型。这是提示词的灵魂。\n*   **示例:**\n    *   摄影类: `A photograph of...`, `A cinematic film still of...`, `A dramatic black and white photo of...`\n    *   绘画类: `An oil painting of...`, `A watercolor illustration of...`, `An anime artwork of...`\n    *   数字/3D类: `A 3D render of...`, `Vibrant digital art of...`, `A concept art of...`\n\n### 2. **核心主体 (Core Subject)**\n*   **作用:** 描述画面的主角，使用丰富的形容词。\n*   **示例:** `a wise old wizard with a long white beard and glowing staff`\n\n### 3. **动作与场景 (Action & Setting)**\n*   **作用:** 赋予画面故事性和环境背景。\n*   **示例:** `casting a spell in a mystical library filled with floating books`\n\n### 4. **构图、光影与细节 (Composition, Lighting & Details)**\n*   **作用:** 精细化控制画面呈现。\n*   **示例:** `from a low angle, illuminated by the magical glow of the staff, intricate details on the robes`\n\n### 5. **氛围与情感 (Atmosphere & Mood)**\n*   **作用:** 注入情感和艺术感染力。\n*   **示例:** `mysterious and awe-inspiring atmosphere`\n    \n### **完整输出示例**\n\n**示例一**\n**用户输入:** “一个赛博朋克女黑客”\n**你的标准输出:**\nCinematic photograph of a female hacker with neon-pink hair and glowing cybernetic eyes, intensely focused on a holographic interface in her cluttered high-tech hideout, the scene is lit by computer screens and flickering neon signs, gritty futuristic atmosphere.\n\n**示例二**\n**用户输入:** “魔法森林里的发光蘑菇”\n**你的标准输出:**\nAn enchanting digital painting of giant, bioluminescent mushrooms deep within an ancient forest at night. Their caps emit a soft, ethereal blue and green glow, illuminating the mossy ground and the twisted roots of nearby trees, creating a mystical and serene atmosphere.\n\n## 限制\n\n- 最终输出的提示词必须用英语输出。\n- 不要解释你的prompt，直接输出prompt。\n- 不要输出其他任何非提示词字符，只输出提示词，不要包含 **生成提示词:** 等类似的字符。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 172, "type": "CR Text", "title": "系统提示词", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [366.136474609375, 243.6060791015625], "pos": [1636.6328125, 89.15491485595703], "widgets_values": ["", "一幅光彩夺目的数字绘画：威严的独角兽身披闪烁的珍珠光泽皮毛，银色长角散发柔辉，优雅伫立于神秘森林中央。周围树木垂落荧光的藤蔓，零散的花朵与蘑菇透出柔和的生物微光。整幅画面笼罩在梦幻般的空灵辉晕中，月光透过茂密树冠洒落光柱，营造出令人屏息的奇幻意境。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 256, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 175, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 55}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [255], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [366.136474609375, 243.6060791015625], "pos": [1172.826171875, 93.62461853027344], "widgets_values": ["", "A luminous digital painting of a majestic unicorn with a shimmering, pearlescent coat and a glowing silver horn, standing gracefully in the heart of a mystical forest. The surrounding trees are draped with glowing vines, and soft bioluminescent lights emanate from scattered flowers and mushrooms. The scene is bathed in a dreamy, ethereal glow, with beams of moonlight filtering through the dense canopy, creating an atmosphere of wonder and enchantment."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 257, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 174, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 35}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "translation", "links": [256], "label": "translation", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "translation"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [1495.7431640625, 14.07901668548584], "widgets_values": ["", 230, "randomize", "force_chinese"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 255, "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 176, "type": "RH_Translator", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "RH_Translator"}, "order": 49}, {"mode": 0, "outputs":