tputs": [{"name": "translation", "links": [269], "label": "translation", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "translation"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [4355.9619140625, 19.140338897705078], "widgets_values": ["", 532, "randomize", "force_chinese"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 271, "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 193, "type": "RH_Translator", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "RH_Translator"}, "order": 54}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [366.136474609375, 243.6060791015625], "pos": [6167.67724609375, 223.81088256835938], "widgets_values": ["", "一张肤色白皙、留着齐肩黑发的亚裔女性照片，她自信地站在涂鸦满布的城市隧道中。外搭蓝色牛仔夹克，内穿印有BIG字样和红色图案的黑色T恤，下身配高腰红蓝格子迷你裙。她的红唇与淡雅妆容形成鲜明对比，右手叉腰，目光平静地微微向右凝视。隧道墙面布满彩色涂鸦，红色、黄色与黑色的喷绘标记交织其中。工业风天花裸露着横梁，荧光灯照亮场景，略显磨损的水泥地面为整体增添粗粝都市感。造型风格是现代街头服饰，休闲中透着不羁。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 288, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 214, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 59}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [287], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [366.136474609375, 243.6060791015625], "pos": [5703.87158203125, 228.2805633544922], "widgets_values": ["", "Photograph of an Asian woman with fair skin and shoulder-length black hair, standing confidently in a graffiti-covered urban tunnel. She wears a blue denim jacket over a black T-shirt with \"BIG\" and a red graphic print, paired with a high-waisted, red-and-blue plaid mini skirt. Her red lipstick contrasts with her neutral makeup. Her right hand rests on her hip, and she gazes slightly to the right with a calm expression. The tunnel walls are adorned with colorful graffiti, featuring red, yellow, and black tags and designs. The ceiling is industrial with exposed beams, and flu